---
import Layout from "../layouts/Main.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cookies - Dover & District Beekeepers' Association"
  description="Information about how the Dover & District Beekeepers' Association website uses cookies, browser local storage, and privacy-friendly analytics."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-8">
        Cookies
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        The Dover & District Beekeepers' Association website (ddbka.co.uk) is
        designed with visitor privacy in mind. We do not set any first-party
        cookies, and we use cookieless analytics to understand general site
        traffic without tracking individuals.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-12 mt-12">
      <!-- Cookies We Set -->
      <section
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">Cookies We Set</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Cookies are small text files that websites can ask your browser to
          store on your device.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          This website does <strong>not</strong> set any first-party cookies,
          advertising cookies, or cross-site tracking cookies. Because we do not
          use non-essential first-party cookies, you will not see a cookie
          consent banner when browsing our pages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Browser Local Storage -->
      <section
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">
          Browser Local Storage (Display Preferences)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Instead of cookies, this website uses your browser's <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 text-sm">localStorage</code> strictly
          to remember your display and accessibility preferences on your
          device. This information never leaves your browser and is not sent to
          our servers.
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-sm md:text-base">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">
                <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-semibold">Key</th>
                <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-semibold">Purpose</th>
                <th class="py-3 font-semibold">Values</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 dark:divide-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
                  theme-preference
                </td>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4">
                  Remembers your chosen colour theme across page loads.
                </td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-sm">
                  light, dark, or system
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
                  font-size-preference
                </td>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4">
                  Remembers your chosen text size setting for readability.
                </td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-sm">
                  100%, 112.5%, or 125%
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Cookieless Website Analytics -->
      <section
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">
          Cookieless Website Analytics
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          To help us understand which pages and resources are most helpful to
          members and visitors, we measure general website traffic using
          privacy-first, cookieless tools. These tools do not set cookies, do
          not store personal identifiers, and do not track you across other
          websites:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <li>
            <strong>Simple Analytics</strong> &mdash; privacy-friendly analytics
            with no cookies and no personal data collection. You can view our
            public statistics on the <a
              href="https://www.simpleanalytics.com/ddbka.co.uk"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-500 font-semibold hover:underline"
              >Simple Analytics dashboard</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Vercel Web Analytics</strong> &mdash; cookieless, aggregated
            traffic metrics provided by our hosting platform, Vercel.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Third-Party Embedded Content -->
      <section
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">
          Third-Party Embedded Content
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Our <a
            href="/hornets"
            class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-500 font-semibold hover:underline"
            >Yellow-legged Asian Hornets</a> page
          embeds an educational video from <strong>YouTube</strong>. When
          you visit that page or play the video, YouTube (Google) may set
          third-party cookies on your device in accordance with <a
            href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-500 font-semibold hover:underline"
            >Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Managing Cookies and Site Data -->
      <section
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">
          Managing Cookies and Site Data
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          You can view, block, or delete cookies and browser local storage at
          any time through your browser settings. Clearing local storage for
          this site will simply reset your colour theme and text-size
          preferences back to their default settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Questions -->
      <section
        class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-amber-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">Questions</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          If you have any questions about cookies, privacy, or how this website
          works, please get in touch via our <a
            href="/contact"
            class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-500 font-semibold hover:underline"
            >Contact Us</a> page.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Email us at: <a
            href="mailto:enquiries@ddbka.co.uk"
            class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-500 font-semibold hover:underline"
            >enquiries@ddbka.co.uk</a
          >
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

